          <h2 style="font-size: var(--fs-56); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);" data-en="Everything you need to know about a 30-yard dumpster." data-es="Todo lo que necesitas saber sobre un contenedor de 30 yardas.">Everything you need to know about a 30-yard dumpster.</h2>

          <h3 data-en="What is a 30-yard roll-off dumpster?" data-es="¿Qué es un contenedor roll-off de 30 yardas?">What is a 30-yard roll-off dumpster?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="The 30-yard is our largest roll-off — the demolition and commercial workhorse. Dimensions: <strong>22 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 6 feet tall</strong>, open-top with a swing-door for walk-in loading. Thirty cubic yards holds roughly 9 full-size pickup truck loads of debris, making this the right choice when a 25-yard would mean a second haul." data-es="El 30 yardas es nuestro roll-off más grande — el caballo de batalla para demolición y trabajo comercial. Dimensiones: <strong>22 pies de largo, 8 pies de ancho y 6 pies de alto</strong>, abierto por arriba con puerta abatible para carga a pie. Treinta yardas cúbicas albergan aproximadamente 9 cargas de camioneta de escombros, lo que lo convierte en la opción correcta cuando un 25 yardas significaría un segundo viaje.">The 30-yard is our largest roll-off — the demolition and commercial workhorse. Dimensions: <strong>22 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 6 feet tall</strong>, open-top with a swing-door for walk-in loading. Thirty cubic yards holds roughly 9 full-size pickup truck loads of debris, making this the right choice when a 25-yard would mean a second haul.</p>
          <p data-en="The 30-yard is what we deliver for teardowns, full commercial cleanouts, and multi-family property turnovers. The taller 6-foot side walls add real capacity over a 25, and the extra two feet of length opens up the walk-in loading angle. If your job is borderline between a 25 and a 30, the 30 is usually the right insurance pick — the price difference is small enough that avoiding a second haul wins." data-es="El 30 yardas es lo que entregamos para demoliciones, limpiezas comerciales completas y renovaciones de propiedades multifamiliares. Las paredes laterales más altas de 6 pies añaden capacidad real sobre un 25, y los dos pies extra de largo abren el ángulo de carga a pie. Si tu trabajo está en el límite entre un 25 y un 30, el 30 suele ser la opción segura — la diferencia de precio es lo bastante pequeña como para que evitar un segundo viaje gane.">The 30-yard is what we deliver for teardowns, full commercial cleanouts, and multi-family property turnovers. The taller 6-foot side walls add real capacity over a 25, and the extra two feet of length opens up the walk-in loading angle. If your job is borderline between a 25 and a 30, the 30 is usually the right insurance pick — the price difference is small enough that avoiding a second haul wins.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Common 30-yard projects in the DMV" data-es="Proyectos comunes de 30 yardas en el DMV">Common 30-yard projects in the DMV</h3>
          <p data-en="For more than 25 years of demolition and commercial work across Prince George's, Montgomery, and the District, these are the projects that almost always land on the 30-yard:" data-es="Por más de 25 años de trabajo de demolición y comercial en Prince George's, Montgomery y el Distrito, estos son los proyectos que casi siempre terminan en el 30 yardas:">For more than 25 years of demolition and commercial work across Prince George's, Montgomery, and the District, these are the projects that almost always land on the 30-yard:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Full demolitions.</strong> Detached garage teardowns, deck removals, in-ground pool demos (lighter materials only), shed and outbuilding teardowns. The default for any structure coming down." data-es="<strong>Demoliciones completas.</strong> Demolición de garajes independientes, remoción de terrazas, demolición de piscinas subterráneas (solo materiales ligeros), demolición de cobertizos y construcciones anexas. La opción predeterminada para cualquier estructura que se derribe."><strong>Full demolitions.</strong> Detached garage teardowns, deck removals, in-ground pool demos (lighter materials only), shed and outbuilding teardowns. The default for any structure coming down.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Commercial construction and tenant fit-outs.</strong> Restaurant build-outs, retail-space turn-overs, office demos, medical-office reconfigures. Commercial accounts welcome — ask about billing." data-es="<strong>Construcción comercial y acondicionamiento de locales.</strong> Construcción de restaurantes, renovaciones de tiendas, demoliciones de oficinas, reconfiguraciones de consultorios médicos. Cuentas comerciales bienvenidas — pregunta por la facturación."><strong>Commercial construction and tenant fit-outs.</strong> Restaurant build-outs, retail-space turn-overs, office demos, medical-office reconfigures. Commercial accounts welcome — ask about billing.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Bulk-volume light-material hauls.</strong> Drywall scrap from a multi-unit build, cardboard and packaging from a warehouse cleanout, foam and pallet waste from a fulfillment operation." data-es="<strong>Cargas de gran volumen de material ligero.</strong> Restos de paneles de yeso de una construcción de varias unidades, cartón y empaques de una limpieza de almacén, espuma y desechos de tarimas de una operación de distribución."><strong>Bulk-volume light-material hauls.</strong> Drywall scrap from a multi-unit build, cardboard and packaging from a warehouse cleanout, foam and pallet waste from a fulfillment operation.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Multi-family cleanouts and evictions.</strong> Apartment-building turn-overs after a lease ends, condo-association common-area cleanups, eviction debris hauls." data-es="<strong>Limpiezas multifamiliares y desalojos.</strong> Renovaciones de edificios de apartamentos al terminar un contrato, limpiezas de áreas comunes de asociaciones de condominios, cargas de escombros de desalojos."><strong>Multi-family cleanouts and evictions.</strong> Apartment-building turn-overs after a lease ends, condo-association common-area cleanups, eviction debris hauls.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Estate and hoarder property cleanouts.</strong> The largest single-family cleanout jobs where decades of accumulation fill a whole 30 with room to spare." data-es="<strong>Limpiezas de patrimonio y propiedades acumuladas.</strong> Los trabajos de limpieza unifamiliar más grandes, donde décadas de acumulación llenan un 30 completo con espacio de sobra."><strong>Estate and hoarder property cleanouts.</strong> The largest single-family cleanout jobs where decades of accumulation fill a whole 30 with room to spare.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 data-en="How much weight can a 30-yard hold?" data-es="¿Cuánto peso aguanta un 30 yardas?">How much weight can a 30-yard hold?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="Every 30-yard rental includes a <strong>3-ton (6,000 lb) tonnage allowance</strong>; excess weight is billed at $105 per additional ton over the allowance. For most light-material commercial and demolition projects, 3 tons is plenty — drywall, framing, packaging, and furniture rarely push the weight limit. For heavy-debris projects (concrete, roofing tear-offs over 50 squares, brick, dirt), we quote a separate heavy-debris line because volume isn't the constraint, weight is. Note that heavy aggregates like dirt, concrete, and asphalt only come in our 10-, 15-, and 20-yard containers." data-es="Cada renta de 30 yardas incluye un <strong>límite de tonelaje de 3 toneladas (6,000 lb)</strong>; el peso excedente se cobra a $105 por tonelada adicional sobre el límite. Para la mayoría de proyectos comerciales y de demolición con material ligero, 3 toneladas son suficientes — los paneles de yeso, la madera, los empaques y los muebles rara vez sobrepasan el límite de peso. Para proyectos de escombros pesados (concreto, remociones de techo de más de 50 cuadros, ladrillo, tierra), cotizamos una línea aparte de escombros pesados porque la limitación no es el volumen, es el peso. Ten en cuenta que los agregados pesados como tierra, concreto y asfalto solo van en nuestros contenedores de 10, 15 y 20 yardas.">Every 30-yard rental includes a <strong>3-ton (6,000 lb) tonnage allowance</strong>; excess weight is billed at $105 per additional ton over the allowance. For most light-material commercial and demolition projects, 3 tons is plenty — drywall, framing, packaging, and furniture rarely push the weight limit. For heavy-debris projects (concrete, roofing tear-offs over 50 squares, brick, dirt), we quote a separate heavy-debris line because volume isn't the constraint, weight is. Note that heavy aggregates like dirt, concrete, and asphalt only come in our 10-, 15-, and 20-yard containers.</p>
          <p data-en="Commercial accounts welcome — ask about billing. Tell us your typical monthly volume and we'll build a standing price sheet — saves time, locks in pricing, and keeps your project schedule predictable." data-es="Cuentas comerciales bienvenidas — pregunta por la facturación. Dinos tu volumen mensual típico y armaremos una hoja de precios fija — ahorra tiempo, fija el precio y mantiene tu cronograma predecible.">Commercial accounts welcome — ask about billing. Tell us your typical monthly volume and we'll build a standing price sheet — saves time, locks in pricing, and keeps your project schedule predictable.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Where will the 30-yard fit on my property?" data-es="¿Dónde cabe el 30 yardas en mi propiedad?">Where will the 30-yard fit on my property?</h3>
          <p data-en="The 30-yard is the largest roll-off we deliver, and it needs commercial or generous-driveway placement. At 22 feet long and 6 feet tall, this isn't a residential-driveway container in most cases:" data-es="El 30 yardas es el roll-off más grande que entregamos, y necesita ubicación comercial o una entrada amplia. Con 22 pies de largo y 6 pies de alto, en la mayoría de los casos no es un contenedor para entrada residencial:">The 30-yard is the largest roll-off we deliver, and it needs commercial or generous-driveway placement. At 22 feet long and 6 feet tall, this isn't a residential-driveway container in most cases:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Active construction sites.</strong> The most common placement. Plenty of room for the truck swing on drop and pull." data-es="<strong>Sitios de construcción activos.</strong> La ubicación más común. Espacio de sobra para el giro del camión al dejar y retirar."><strong>Active construction sites.</strong> The most common placement. Plenty of room for the truck swing on drop and pull.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Commercial parking lots.</strong> Easy if there's room for the 30-ft truck swing arc. Send a satellite-image link and we'll confirm." data-es="<strong>Estacionamientos comerciales.</strong> Fácil si hay espacio para el arco de giro del camión de 30 pies. Envía un enlace de imagen satelital y lo confirmamos."><strong>Commercial parking lots.</strong> Easy if there's room for the 30-ft truck swing arc. Send a satellite-image link and we'll confirm.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Long, level driveways (28+ ft).</strong> Possible on large residential lots. Measure twice and clear overhead obstructions (low branches, power lines)." data-es="<strong>Entradas largas y niveladas (28+ pies).</strong> Posible en lotes residenciales grandes. Mide dos veces y despeja obstáculos elevados (ramas bajas, cables eléctricos)."><strong>Long, level driveways (28+ ft).</strong> Possible on large residential lots. Measure twice and clear overhead obstructions (low branches, power lines).</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> Standard for urban infill projects. We pass permit fees through at cost and can advise on the right office." data-es="<strong>Calle pública (con permiso).</strong> Estándar para proyectos de relleno urbano. Trasladamos los costos del permiso sin recargo y podemos orientarte sobre la oficina correcta."><strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> Standard for urban infill projects. We pass permit fees through at cost and can advise on the right office.</li>
          </ul>
          <p data-en="If you're not sure a 30 will fit, send us a photo of the placement spot and we'll review it before quoting. Sometimes the right answer is two 20-yards instead of one 30 — we'd rather tell you that at the quote than at the curb." data-es="Si no estás seguro de si un 30 cabe, envíanos una foto del lugar de colocación y lo revisaremos antes de cotizar. A veces la respuesta correcta son dos 20 yardas en lugar de un 30 — preferimos decírtelo en la cotización y no en la acera.">If you're not sure a 30 will fit, send us a photo of the placement spot and we'll review it before quoting. Sometimes the right answer is two 20-yards instead of one 30 — we'd rather tell you that at the quote than at the curb.</p>
