          <details class="faq-item"><summary data-en="Will a 30-yard fit on my residential property?" data-es="¿Cabe un 30 yardas en mi propiedad residencial?">Will a 30-yard fit on my residential property?</summary><div class="faq-answer" data-en="Only on larger lots. The 30 is 22 ft long and needs at least 26–28 ft of clear placement length. Most residential drops happen on active construction sites, commercial lots, or in the public right-of-way with a permit. Send us a placement photo and we'll spec it." data-es="Solo en lotes grandes. El 30 mide 22 pies de largo y necesita al menos 26–28 pies de espacio libre de colocación. La mayoría de las entregas residenciales ocurren en sitios de construcción activos, lotes comerciales o en la vía pública con permiso. Envíanos una foto del lugar y lo especificamos.">Only on larger lots. The 30 is 22 ft long and needs at least 26–28 ft of clear placement length. Most residential drops happen on active construction sites, commercial lots, or in the public right-of-way with a permit. Send us a placement photo and we'll spec it.</div></details>
